# Docker builds use the repo root as context (see docker/Dockerfile), but the
# image only needs web/. Keep everything else out so builds stay fast; raw/
# alone is ~500 MB. Patterns without **/ only match at the repo root.
.git
raw*
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
web/dist
web_test
Prompts
Planning Phase
docker/*.ps1
*.md
*.txt
# The runtime image installs the API from this file. Keep the broad text-file
# exclusion for generated notes, but allow this required build input.
!src/optimal_hospital_placer/api/requirements.txt
*.svg
**/.env

# The self-contained image includes only the explicitly prepared runtime copy.
# These negations override the general *.parquet exclusion above.
!docker/runtime-data/
!docker/runtime-data/**
